{
  "id": "195",
  "title": "Number Poem",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-11-12",
  "synopsis": "A famous Chinese poem depicts a snow storm near the plum blossom.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/272/47ab4475b4e82a13a2129d4ef28c4a5f60028c87.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "数字诗\n\n    “一片两片三四片，五片六片七八片，九片十片无数片，飞入梅花看不见。”\n    怎么都是数字？这也能算是诗吗？是的，这是一首在中国非常有名的诗。写的是这样的一个场景：天上下着大雪，雪花一片两片三片四片地落下来。雪越下越大，无数片雪花落下来。无数片雪花飞到梅花中，突然就看不见了。\n    怎么样？其实诗也不是很难吧？",
    "traditional": "數字詩\n\n    “一片兩片三四片，五片六片七八片，九片十片無數片，飛入梅花看不見。”\n    怎麼都是數字？這也能算是詩嗎？是的，這是一首在中國非常有名的詩。寫的是這樣的一個場景：天上下著大雪，雪花一片兩片三片四片地落下來。雪越下越大，無數片雪花落下來。無數片雪花飛到梅花中，突然就看不見了。\n    怎麼樣？其實詩也不是很難吧？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Number Poem"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "“一片两片三四片，五片六片七八片，",
      "traditional": "“一片兩片三四片，五片六片七八片，",
      "pinyin": "yí piàn liǎng piàn sān sì piàn wǔ piàn liù piàn qī bā piàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "九片十片无数片，飞入梅花看不见。”",
      "traditional": "九片十片無數片，飛入梅花看不見。”",
      "pinyin": "jiǔ piàn shí piàn wú shù piàn fēi rù méi huā kàn bu jiàn",
      "english": "One flake, two flakes, three four flakes. Five flakes, six flakes, seven eight flakes."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Nine flakes, ten flakes, uncountable flakes, when they reach the plum blossoms they are no longer seen."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "怎么都是数字？",
      "traditional": "怎麼都是數字？",
      "pinyin": "zěn me dōu shì shù zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "这也能算是诗吗？",
      "traditional": "這也能算是詩嗎？",
      "pinyin": "zhè yě néng suàn shì shī ma",
      "english": "How come it's all numbers?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "是的，这是一首在中国非常有名的诗。",
      "traditional": "是的，這是一首在中國非常有名的詩。",
      "pinyin": "shì de zhè shì yì shǒu zài zhōng guó fēi cháng yǒu míng de shī",
      "english": "Can this really be called a poem?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "写的是这样的一个场景：天上下着大雪，雪花一片两片三片四片地落下来。",
      "traditional": "寫的是這樣的一個場景：天上下著大雪，雪花一片兩片三片四片地落下來。",
      "pinyin": "xiě de shì zhè yàng de yí ge chǎng jǐng tiān shang xià zhe dà xuě xuě huā yí piàn liǎng piàn sān piàn sì piàn de luò xià lai",
      "english": "It is. This is a very famous poem in China."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "雪越下越大，无数片雪花落下来。",
      "traditional": "雪越下越大，無數片雪花落下來。",
      "pinyin": "xuě yuè xià yuè dà wú shù piàn xuě huā luò xià lai",
      "english": "It depicts the following scene: Heavy snow falls from the skies, and the flakes come falling down one by one."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "无数片雪花飞到梅花中，突然就看不见了。",
      "traditional": "無數片雪花飛到梅花中，突然就看不見了。",
      "pinyin": "wú shù piàn xuě huā fēi dào méi huā zhōng tū rán jiù kàn bu jiàn le",
      "english": "The intensity of the snowfall increases, and soon an uncountable amount of snowflakes is falling."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The uncountable snowflakes fly into the white plum blossom, and suddenly they can no longer be seen."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "怎么样？其实诗也不是很难吧？",
      "traditional": "怎麼樣？其實詩也不是很難吧？",
      "pinyin": "zěn me yàng qí shí shī yě bú shì hěn nán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What do you think? Poems are actually not that difficult, right?"
    }
  ],
