    "sentence_translations": [
      "Number Poem",
      "",
      "One flake, two flakes, three four flakes. Five flakes, six flakes, seven eight flakes.",
      "Nine flakes, ten flakes, uncountable flakes, when they reach the plum blossoms they are no longer seen.",
      "",
      "How come it's all numbers?",
      "Can this really be called a poem?",
      "It is. This is a very famous poem in China.",
      "It depicts the following scene: Heavy snow falls from the skies, and the flakes come falling down one by one.",
      "The intensity of the snowfall increases, and soon an uncountable amount of snowflakes is falling.",
      "The uncountable snowflakes fly into the white plum blossom, and suddenly they can no longer be seen.",
      "",
      "What do you think? Poems are actually not that difficult, right?",
      ""
    ]
  }
